Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟离开屋子 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是爸爸的笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was Dad's book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.31,0:00:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people. Hunting things. The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得找到爸爸 这是现在我唯一想干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find Dad. It's the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}需要多大电流才\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got those amped up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.89,0:00:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十万伏特\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred thousand volts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.81,0:00:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么强的电流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 我想这会那妖怪也感到很爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this Rawhead extra crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记住你得一击即中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember, you only get one shot with these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:00:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So make it count.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.31,0:01:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里 1… 2… 3\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.59,0:01:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它还在这里么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓住你姐姐的手 跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your sister's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.13,0:02:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 让他们离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.95,0:02:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我不得不问下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好象这里没有任何保险的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}There doesn't seem to be any insurance on file.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯克威茨先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mr. Burkowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们待会在打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can finish this up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正好从邻居家穿过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just taking a shortcut through the neighborhood…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的窗户震碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our windows were down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们走过那房子的时候 听见了尖叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we heard some screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就跑了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we stopped, ran in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就发现这个孩子在地下室吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found the kids in the basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 谢谢你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Well, thank God you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.47,0:03:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他还在昏迷吗 - 他在休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, doc. Is he? - He's resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}电击引起的心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}The electrocution triggered a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:03:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相当严重 我恐怕… 。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty massive, l'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的心脏受到了损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart, it's damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}损伤到什么程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}How damaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done all we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在能让他暂时稳定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can try and keep him comfortable at this point…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我看他过不了几个礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I give him a couple weeks at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最多一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 应该还有些其他方法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, there's gotta be something you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他的治疗手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能指望奇迹 我非常遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't work miracles. I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前还没看过白天的电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever actually watched daytime TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这节目实在太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚才和你的医生谈了下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to your doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}泰迪熊软化剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That fabric softener teddy bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 我想揍那婊子一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. I'm gonna hunt that little bitch down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.75,0:04:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 看来你得扔下我 自己离开这镇子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, looks like you're gonna leave town without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么呢 我不会扔下你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? I'm not gonna leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得小心我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna take care of that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不然我发誓做鬼也会缠着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I swear I'll haunt your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这一点也不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't think that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:04:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮个忙 笑一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, come on, it's a little funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.23,0:05:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 那我该说些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sam, what can I say, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.65,0:05:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是份危险的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dangerous gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惜我没法子完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drew the short straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.32,0:05:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别跟我说那样的话 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk like that, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还有其他的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have options.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.27,0:05:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}What options?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}土葬还是火葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got burial or cremation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这很难抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not easy…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是… 我快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but l'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你还得继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在无法接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有急事的话 请打个我的儿子迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is an emergency, call my son, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}866- 907- 3235\N{\fnArial\fs30}866-907-3235.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 爸爸 是我 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad, it's Sam. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能不会听到这个电话 但是 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably won't even get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:05:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且医生说他们无计可施\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sick and the doctor said there's nothing they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们并不了解我们的所干的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they don't know the things we know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别担心 我会想尽一切办法 让他好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't worry, because l'm gonna do whatever it takes to get him better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是通知你一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这是在干什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会死在一个连个漂亮护士 也没有的医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna die in a hospital where the nurses aren't even hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是真的 微笑面对死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this whole "I laugh in the face of death" thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞎说 我看根本就不是这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's crap. I can see right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随你怎么说 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你睡过了吗 你看上去比我还糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you even slept? You look worse than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这三天都在上网\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been scouring the Internet for the last three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寻找一切所有与爸爸日记 里有关的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling every contact in Dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:06:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.43,0:07:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了找到帮你的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a way to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of Dad's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约书亚 他打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joshua, he called me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我在内布拉斯加州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told me about a guy in Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一位医学专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会让我就这样安静的死去 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna let me die in peace, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然不会让你死啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you die, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我帮你 - 我自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got you. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 你还真会吹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you're a lying bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你原先说是来看一个医生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said we're going to see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说医学专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I said a specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他应该就是我们要找的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's supposed to be the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.52,0:07:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不敢相信你居然让我来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you brought me to see some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个在帐篷里治病的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}who heals people out of a tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格兰神父是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend Le Grange is a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有权抗议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a right to protest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这家伙是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man's a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在骗取这些人的血汗钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bilking all these people out of their money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里就是举行仪式的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this is a place of worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来人还不少啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it he's not part of the flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当人们看见一些无法解释的东西的时候 就产生了争议\N{\fnArial\fs30}When people see what they can't explain, there's controversy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但萨姆 他是一个信仰医疗学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But come on, Sam, a faith healer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.31,0:08:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能也是该是时候需要些信仰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time to have a little faith, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我信仰什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I got faith in? Reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实 了解正在发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing what's really going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.49,0:08:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着每天在我们身边的事 你怎么能是个无神论者\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be a skeptic with the things we see every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 我们能看见它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. We see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道它们是真的存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know they're real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.73,0:08:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你知道邪恶在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know evil's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你怎么能不相信那里也有上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you not believe good's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我也见到过邪恶的东西并 没伤害到人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've seen what evil does to good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可能是上帝暗地里干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe God works in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你让我对这里产生了兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you turned me around on the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, l'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.98,0:08:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是迪恩 这是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm Dean, this is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Layla.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.73,0:08:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然你并不是信徒 那你来这里干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're not a believer, then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我兄弟觉得这对我们两个人都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apparently my brother here believes enough for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 蕾拉 快要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Layla, it's about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:08:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟你打赌她也是一个信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I bet you she can work in some mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和平 友爱 互信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, peace, love and trust all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来吧 - 就坐这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Sit right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.05,0:09:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们坐到前面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sitting up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.36,0:09:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来吧 - 噢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Oh, come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 我自己行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你占了过道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每天早上 我妻子苏安 读新闻给我听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each morning my wife, Sue Ann, reads me the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但总没什么好事报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seems good, does it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总是有些人又做了不道德的 坏透了的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like there's always someone committing some immoral unspeakable act.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我可以告诉你 上帝正监视着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I say to you God is watching. Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝会奖励那些好人 同时也会惩罚那些坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}God rewards the good and he punishes the corrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋友们正是上帝保佑着这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the Lord who does the healing here, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挑选接受治疗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord who guides me in choosing who to heal…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝帮助我看穿人心来\N{\fnArial\fs30}by helping me see into people's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门 又或者伸向他们的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or into their wallets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也是怎么想的吗 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think so, young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在瞎子面前说话你得小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch what you say around a blind man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的耳朵还真不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got real sharp ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想请你到我这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to come up here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到这里不就是想痊愈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come here to be healed, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 没错 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以叫其他人上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should just pick someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是我选择了你 是上帝选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't pick you, Dean, the Lord did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赞美主 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the Lord, amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我并不想冒犯你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, look, no disrespect…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我并不是一个信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}but l'm not exactly a believer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子 你会是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.25,0:11:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋友们让我们一起祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray with me, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.85,0:12:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说话呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在真的感觉好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you really feel okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很好 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel fine, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:13:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据你的测试报告 你的心脏没有问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, according to all your tests there's nothing wrong with your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有任何迹象表明它之前有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign there ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}象你这年纪应该不会有心脏问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that a man your age should have heart trouble…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.61,0:13:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但仍然很奇怪 确有这样的事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but still, it's strange. Does happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的奇怪是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在昨天 一个和你年纪相仿的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just yesterday, a young guy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个27岁的运动员死于心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}27, athletic. Out of nowhere, heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能只是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人的心脏随时都可能出问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}People's hearts give out all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 并不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道还真的要吹毛求疵不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to look this one in the mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们为什么不能谢谢那个救你的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't we be thankful the guy saved your life and move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我无法逃避这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can't shake this feeling, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么样的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我痊愈的时候 我感到有些不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was healed, I just I felt wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感到冷 虽然就一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt cold and for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见那个老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw someone, this old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 萨姆他是个幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, it was a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果真的是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我也应该能看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've seen it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只看到非常难堪的场面罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been seeing an awful lot of things lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打断一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, excuse me, psychic wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need a little faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我捕猎这么久了 足以深信这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, l've been hunting long enough to trust a feeling like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不去看下 那个发心脏病的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out the heart-attack guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真想去拜访那神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna visit the Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感觉棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我想了解下 到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to, you know, make sense of what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇迹发生了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A miracle is what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇迹经常在罗伊身边发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miracles come so often around Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.19,0:14:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么时候开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did they start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那所谓的奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The miracles?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一天我醒来瞎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woke up one morning stone blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生说我得了癌症 告诉我还有一个月的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors figured out I had cancer, told me I had maybe a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我祈祷出现奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we prayed for a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我那时很虚弱 但和Sue说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was weak, but I told Sue Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要坚持不懈的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You just keep right on praying."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接着我昏迷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went into a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生说我可能再也不会醒过来 但我苏醒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors said I wouldn't wake up, but I did…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}癌症也随之而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the cancer was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这事不是这几年发生的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't for these eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.59,0:14:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还真没有人会相信有这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one would believe I'd ever had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你就能治疗其他的人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suddenly you could heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我后来发现的确是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I discovered it afterwards, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝一直保佑着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's blessed me in many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的追随者日夜增多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his flock just swelled overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这还只是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能问你个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you one last question?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 为什么是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管其他病人救助我 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of all the sick people, why save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我刚才所说的 是上帝指引了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, like I said before, the Lord guides me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看穿了你的心 而你也正好从人群中站了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked into your heart and you just stood out from all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从我的心中看到了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see in my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个有远大目标的年轻人 想干一翻事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young man with an important purpose, a job to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但还没完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it isn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 他看上去很健康 每天都游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telling you, he seemed healthy. Swam every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不吸烟 所以他得心脏病 比较奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't smoke. You know, so a heart attack just kind of seemed bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据你所说的他病倒的 那天还正在跑步吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said he was running right before he collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, he was freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说有些东西正跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said that something was after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他都说了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thin air is what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好象没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there wasn't anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 伙计 你的钟坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, your clock's busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 好象不走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, we can't get it working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在4 17冻住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just froze at 4:1 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马歇尔就是那个时候死的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the same time Marshall died?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 - 嘿 - 感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, hey. - Hey. - How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很好 我想应该已经痊愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l feel good. Cured, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来这干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她想和神父谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}she wanted to talk to the Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Layla.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we're here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 罗伊正在休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, l'm sorry, but Roy's resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在不接见任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be seeing anyone else right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.35,0:16:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏安 帮帮忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue Ann, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们第6次来了 他应该接见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our sixth time. He's got to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:16:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊也知道蕾拉的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy's well aware of Layla's situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要上帝允许他肯定愿意帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he very much wants to help…just as soon as the Lord allows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 洛克太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have faith, Mrs. Rourke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干吗还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you still even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经得到你想要的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈 不要说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾拉这太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Layla, this is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.19,0:17:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去过所有的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been to every single service.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果罗伊还是选择其他陌生人而不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Roy would stop choosing these strangers over you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们根本就不是信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}strangers who don't even believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经非常至诚的祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't pray any harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾拉 到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Layla, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是脑瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a brain tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且无法动手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's inoperable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在六个月内 医生说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In six months, the doctors say…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你能活的比我女儿长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you deserve to live more than my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.97,0:18:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马歇尔死于4 17\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshall Hall died at 4:1 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是我痊愈的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The exact time I was healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 因此我把痊愈的人放在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.So I put together a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些受罗伊治疗去年一共六个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend Roy's healed six people over the past year…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我核对了当时当地的讣告\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I checked them with the local obits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次有人痊愈 就有人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time someone was healed, someone else died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次受害者都死于与被治愈者 相同的病症\N{\fnArial\fs30}And each time the victim died of the same symptom Le Grange was healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些人癌症被治愈 而有些人却死于癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's healed of cancer, someone else dies of cancer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洛克·格兰奇正在用一个生命 换另一个生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow Le Grange is trading a life for another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以马歇尔的死就是为了救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Marshall Hall died to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 他也可能死于其他的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the guy probably would've died anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而也有人因此被治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and someone else would've been healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不该带我去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never should have brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我只是想救你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I was just trying to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 那个人是因我而死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Sam, some guy is dead now because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不关心这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋友们和我一起祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray with me, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不了解这些罗伊是如何做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing I don't understand is, how is Roy doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.31,0:19:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如何以命换命\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he trading a life for a life?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.21,0:19:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是他干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy is not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是其他人替他干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something else is doing it for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思 在舞台上的那个老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you mean? The old man I saw on-stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不相信这些表面现象 但我却知道这背后是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't want to believe it, but I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说些什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一种生物能这样夺走生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one thing can give and take life like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.16,0:20:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正面对这一个死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with a reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的认为那是死神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think it's the Grim Reaper…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象毁灭天使 吸取你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, Angel of Death, collect your soul, the whole deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是这种死神 是另外种\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, not the Reaper, a reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每种不同的文化里的死神都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's reaper lore in every culture on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有一百多种不同的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go by different names.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个可能有不只一个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible there's more than one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说你看见一个套状的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you saw a dude in a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得他就和里面的角色一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, he should've been working the black robe thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说那个钟停止不走了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it yourself that the clock stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死神停止了时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reapers stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有他来到你身边你才能见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can only see them when they're coming at you…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.81,0:21:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是为什么我可以看见 而你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I could see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可能吧 - 除此之外也没其他可能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - There's nothing else it could be, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题是 罗伊是怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, how's Roy controlling the thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.01,0:21:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十字架\N{\fnArial\fs30}That cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:21:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:21:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那有个十字架\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我注意到了那个教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed it in the church tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我以前在哪里见到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew l'd seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塔罗牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tarot?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塔罗牌要追溯到公元早期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tarot dates back to the early Christian era…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.59,0:22:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当有一些牧师在使用魔法 …\N{\fnArial\fs30}when priests were using magic and.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而另外一些则成了恶魔的奴仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few veered into the dark stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}产生了巫术和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Necromancy and how to push death away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如何长生不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to cause it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是说罗伊于死神用黑魔法 签下了契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Roy's using black magic to bind the reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是那样的话 那就没人能收拾他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he is, he's riding the whirlwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.48,0:22:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象带着项圈的狗无人看管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like putting a dog leash on a great white.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 我们来阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then we stop Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.15,0:22:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.49,0:22:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你又在瞎说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能杀了罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't kill Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那家伙正扮演着上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, the guy's playing God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.09,0:22:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}决定人的生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's deciding who lives and dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但对我来说只是个妖怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我们不能杀人 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not gonna kill a human being, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.47,0:22:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们那样做 我们比他也好不到那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do that, we're no better than he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.59,0:22:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 我们不杀罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so we can't kill Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.85,0:23:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不杀死人 还有其他的点子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't kill death. Any bright ideas, college boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果罗伊用符咒控制着死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if Roy's using some kind of black spell on the reaper…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.45,0:23:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得找出如何破解掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}we gotta figure out what it is and how to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.35,0:23:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果罗伊是用的符咒 那可能有符咒书\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Roy's using a spell, there might be a spell book.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.17,0:23:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看你能不能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.37,0:23:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仪式在15分钟内要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Service starts in 1 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.27,0:23:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我试着拖住罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try to stall Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洛克·格兰奇是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy Le Grange is a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.37,0:23:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是治病术士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's no healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.01,0:23:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.79,0:23:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加油 继续干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.53,0:25:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.36,0:25:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊选择那些他认为不道德的人 作为受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy's choosing victims he sees as immoral.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.67,0:25:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我已经知道下一个会是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think I know who's next on his list.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.53,0:25:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得那个抗议者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that protestor?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.69,0:25:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 在停车厂的那个家伙吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the parking lot? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我会找到他 但你不要让罗伊治疗任何人 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, l'll find him. But you can't let Roy heal anyone, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾拉 蕾拉·洛克 到这里来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Layla. Layla Rourke. Come up here, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 妈妈 谢谢你 - 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom. Thank you. - I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.11,0:26:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.86,0:26:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾拉听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Layla, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.37,0:26:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们为此都等了几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've waited for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.65,0:26:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能让罗伊治疗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't let Roy heal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.33,0:26:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.39,0:26:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但罗伊治愈了你 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy healed you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.85,0:26:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我为什么不能让他试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you at least let him try?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.50,0:26:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为如果你这样做 一些不好的事就会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do, something bad is gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.68,0:26:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法解释 但我希望你能相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't explain. I just need to you believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.55,0:26:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 蕾拉 - 不要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Layla. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.37,0:26:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.45,0:26:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾拉 蕾拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Layla Layla.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.98,0:26:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear child.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.03,0:27:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.65,0:27:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝终于最后选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew the Lord was planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.81,0:27:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道只是时间的问题而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.04,0:27:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.12,0:27:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋友们与我一起祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray with me, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.54,0:27:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.76,0:27:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.87,0:27:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救救我 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.51,0:27:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.14,0:27:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.87,0:27:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.47,0:28:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}着火拉 教堂着火拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire! Hurry! Tent's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.14,0:28:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家敢快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire! Everybody get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.82,0:28:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要 求你不要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.55,0:28:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别离开 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't stop. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.56,0:28:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父 求你不要停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend, please, please. Please don't stop. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.41,0:28:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋友们 大家请按秩序离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends, if you'd all just leave the tent in an orderly fashion…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.19,0:28:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会处理这里所发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll figure out what's going on out there and we'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我办到了 我拖住了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}l did it. I stopped Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.53,0:28:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大卫… 我想应该没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, I think it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.41,0:28:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 - 迪恩 这仍然无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Dean, it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.31,0:28:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死神还是来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reaper's still coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.19,0:28:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟你讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我早就跟你讲过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, it must not have worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.72,0:28:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这并不是罗伊控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy must not be controlling this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then who the hell is?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.12,0:28:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.26,0:29:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮帮我 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.59,0:29:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.86,0:29:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事了 你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.92,0:29:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.01,0:29:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.21,0:29:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们为你做了那么多 罗伊治愈了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything we've done for you, after Roy healed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.97,0:29:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们非常非常失望 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just very, very disappointed, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.70,0:29:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们可以让他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.41,0:29:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会起诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna press charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.10,0:30:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝会对付他 因为他是合适的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord will deal with him as he sees fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.99,0:30:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是让我们在抓到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We catch you around here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别怪我们对你不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll put the fear of God in you, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.38,0:30:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, fear of God. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.00,0:30:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蕾拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Layla.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.29,0:30:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.01,0:30:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可能是我唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it could have been my only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.25,0:30:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是治病术士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.68,0:30:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他治愈你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He healed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.72,0:30:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这可能不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it doesn't seem fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.86,0:30:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望我能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wish I could explain…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.01,0:30:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但可惜罗伊并不是我要的答案 很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Roy is not the answer, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.42,0:30:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.56,0:30:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.25,0:30:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.54,0:30:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.14,0:30:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该比我好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserved a lot more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.70,0:31:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚单独会议 不会有打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private session tonight, no interruptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.33,0:31:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you my word,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.32,0:31:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会治愈你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll heal your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.75,0:31:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.82,0:31:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.27,0:31:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以罗伊就深信不疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Roy really believes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.10,0:31:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他还了解他妻子的所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he has any idea what his wife's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现这被藏在图书馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I found this hidden in their library.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.97,0:31:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很巧 这正是一个投奔恶魔 的牧师所写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ancient. Written by a priest who went dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.37,0:31:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一种符咒用来捕获死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a binding spell in here for trapping a reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.19,0:31:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是种毒咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a hell of a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.50,0:31:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 你得用骨头 人血建造一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You gotta build a black altar with seriously dark stuff Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.81,0:31:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑暗祭坛\N{\fnArial\fs30}human blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.40,0:31:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}象这样画个叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cross a line like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.25,0:31:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那神父的妻子是个黑魔法师\N{\fnArial\fs30}That preacher's wife…Black magic, murder. Evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.40,0:31:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为丈夫正奄奄一息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.14,0:31:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不顾一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her husband was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.10,0:31:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要救回他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would've done anything to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.05,0:31:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他用符咒让死神远离罗伊 坦白的说就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was using the binding spell to keep the reaper away from Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.87,0:31:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逃脱死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheating death, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.47,0:32:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但既然罗伊没死 那她为什么还要继续使用这符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Roy's alive, so why's she still using the spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.78,0:32:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.72,0:32:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了迫使死神杀死那些那些 她认为不道德的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To force the reaper to kill people she thinks are immoral.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.34,0:32:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些认为他们在做好事的人们 认为是上帝救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}May God save us from half the people who think they're doing God's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.77,0:32:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得解除那个符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta break that spell, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.59,0:32:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏安有一个象这样的科普特十字架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue Ann had a Coptic cross like this. Once she dropped it…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.79,0:32:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当十字架掉落的时候 死神就退走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the reaper backed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.41,0:32:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你认为我们得找到它 或者摧毁那个祭坛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think we gotta find the cross or destroy the altar?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.28,0:32:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能两者都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe both?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.30,0:32:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么样 我们得快点行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we do, we'd better do it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.00,0:32:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊今晚要治疗蕾拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy's healing Layla tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.86,0:32:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是蕾拉的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Layla's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.23,0:32:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.61,0:32:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.17,0:32:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果罗伊选择了用我 来交换蕾拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Roy picked Layla instead of me…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.87,0:32:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她应该现在正在接受治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'd be healed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.28,0:32:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 别那样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.06,0:32:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她今天没治愈的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if she's not healed tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.91,0:33:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几个月内她就会死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna die in a couple months.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.93,0:33:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对她来说是非常可怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening to her is horrible…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.45,0:33:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.57,0:33:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让其他人的死来救她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let somebody else die to save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.77,0:33:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己说过的 迪恩 你不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}aid it yourself, You can't play God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.58,0:33:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 请大家过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather around. Please, everyone gather around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.42,0:33:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接近 上来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in closer, come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.22,0:33:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏安在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sue Ann?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.95,0:33:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}House.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.82,0:33:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找苏安 我会跟上你的饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find Sue Ann. l'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想干什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.19,0:33:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 你们不是想对我不客气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Gonna put that fear of God in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.54,0:34:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看见他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.60,0:34:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.42,0:34:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杂种狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psycho mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.11,0:35:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给了你兄弟的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave your brother life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.34,0:35:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可以取走它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.90,0:36:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.85,0:36:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝选择了我来惩恶扬善\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord chose me to reward the just and punish the wicked…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.46,0:36:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你兄弟是邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your brother is wicked…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.86,0:36:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是该死的 就象蕾拉应该活下来一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he deserves to die just as Layla deserves to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.10,0:36:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是上帝的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's God's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.25,0:36:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.65,0:36:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洛克太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Rourke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.50,0:36:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在和我一起祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋友们和我一起祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray with me, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.16,0:37:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.44,0:37:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.19,0:37:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}[CHANTING lN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.53,0:37:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}[CHANTING lN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.05,0:37:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}[CHANTING lN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.85,0:37:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.41,0:38:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.90,0:38:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没感觉有什么不同啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel different.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.26,0:38:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天那\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.58,0:38:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都干了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.32,0:38:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是你的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not your God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.38,0:38:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.08,0:38:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏安吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue Ann?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.80,0:39:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.86,0:39:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么鬼日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.90,0:39:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.18,0:39:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.89,0:39:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.11,0:39:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.39,0:39:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.75,0:39:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们做的是对的吧 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did the right thing here, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.69,0:39:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.85,0:39:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感觉还是不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.15,0:39:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 蕾拉 进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Layla, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.37,0:39:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.92,0:39:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道我们在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. How did you know we were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.74,0:39:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam called.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.78,0:39:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说你想道个别\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you wanted to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.41,0:40:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想… 要瓶苏打水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna grab a soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.39,0:40:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们想去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.22,0:40:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.83,0:40:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们这活要到处跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our work kind of takes us all over. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.77,0:40:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去看过了罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I went back to see Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.10,0:40:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.93,0:40:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.27,0:40:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他用手放在我的额头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he laid his hands on my forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.16,0:40:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但什么都没发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.40,0:40:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.03,0:40:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉那没生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.80,0:40:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏安\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sue Ann…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.78,0:40:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.44,0:40:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}中风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.48,0:40:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.27,0:40:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Roy's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.41,0:40:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不该有这下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't deserve what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.63,0:41:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太残忍了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.05,0:41:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对一些东西深信不疑 但结果却让他如此失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}to believe in something so much and have it disappoint you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.96,0:41:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没听到一些奇怪的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna hear something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.86,0:41:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.45,0:41:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事了 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.98,0:41:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想如果即使你是信徒的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess if you're gonna have faith…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.89,0:41:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当奇迹出现你也不能把它当作是信念始然\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't just have it when the miracles happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.76,0:41:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}平时还是需要些信仰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to have it when they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.77,0:41:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那现在又如何了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.66,0:41:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝总是在暗地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}God works in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.26,0:41:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.37,0:41:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.00,0:42:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你了解的 我不经常祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm not much of the praying type…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.72,0:42:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我会为你祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But l'm gonna pray for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.93,0:42:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没想到奇迹那么快就出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…there's a miracle right there.
